.TH quarters-upgrade 1  "quarters-upgrade " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-upgrade \- Assign stable identity to an inactive legacy space
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-upgrade\fR [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-confirm\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Assign stable identity to an inactive legacy space
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR
Validate lease and schema without changing metadata
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Exactly repeat NAME to execute the metadata upgrade
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Existing space to inspect or upgrade
